  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>\"I'm sure you'll win next time. Double or nothing?\"</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Three Card Monty</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you spread your Monty deck face-down in front of your target's player, that player picks one card, then you shuffle the Monty deck, spread it face-down again, and the player picks a second card. Choose one of your target's two picks, and resolve the Monty deck as though that were the only card picked.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Whenever you spread your Monty deck face-down in front of your target's player, that player picks one card, and then the Monty deck resolves.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
